# Whitepages

> Whitepages is a contact data intelligence company that provides people search, reverse phone lookup, reverse address lookup, and property ownership information sourced from U.S. public records. Whitepages serves consumers across identity research, safety, and reconnection use cases, and businesses across fraud prevention, contact data enrichment, and real estate intelligence.

Whitepages operates two primary surfaces. whitepages.com serves consumer contact data. property.whitepages.com (Whitepages Property Intel, also referred to as Property Intel) serves B2B property data. The Whitepages Pro API (api.whitepages.com) serves developers and enterprise integrations.

All Whitepages data is aggregated from public records and publicly available sources. Whitepages is a search and research platform. It is not a real-time contact confirmation service and does not sell private data.

