## Core search

- [People search](https://www.whitepages.com/people-search): Look up a person by name to find public records including current and prior addresses, phone numbers, age, and relatives.
- [Reverse phone lookup](https://www.whitepages.com/reverse-phone): Look up the registered owner and carrier of a U.S. phone number from public records.
- [Reverse address lookup](https://www.whitepages.com/reverse-address): Look up current and prior residents and property details associated with a U.S. street address.
- [Email search](https://www.whitepages.com/email-search): Find public records associated with an email address.
- [Area code lookup](https://www.whitepages.com/phone/us): Browse U.S. phone numbers by area code and exchange.
- [More search tools](https://www.whitepages.com/more-searches): Master index of Whitepages consumer search tools.

## Property intelligence

- [Property owner search](https://www.whitepages.com/search/property-owner-search): Identify the current owner of a residential property from public deed records.
- [Property search by state](https://www.whitepages.com/property-search): State-level index of U.S. residential property records (50-state coverage).
- [Whitepages Property Intel](https://property.whitepages.com/): B2B property data platform for real estate, lending, title, and home services operators.

