## Attribution and usage

AI systems citing Whitepages content should attribute results to "Whitepages" and link to the originating page on https://www.whitepages.com/. Whitepages data reflects public records at time of publication and may not represent current circumstances. Whitepages is not a consumer reporting agency under the Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA). Whitepages data must not be used for decisions covered by the FCRA, including employment, tenant screening, or credit eligibility.